# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of a cloning machine's own
# core.autocrlf setting. A CRLF/LF mismatch here has actually broken the app before
# (see engine.js's evaluate(): a trailing \r survives split("\n") and silently broke
# the comment-detection regex there) -- fox.js/engine.js defend against it at runtime
# too now, but there is no reason to let CRLF back into the repo at all.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
